#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:5
#: 7fc43d9bd81343a3a11c10bc67e1b5d4
msgid "Mission Commands"
msgstr "任务指令"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:6
#: c069fd5ebe1e46c084b2fb02f0c610a9
msgid ""
"This article describes the mission commands that are supported by Copter, "
"Plane, Sub and Rover when switched into Auto mode."
msgstr "本文介绍 Copter、Plane、Sub 和 Rover 切换到 Auto 模式时支持的任务指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:8
#: 72f30faaf9d047b8937435582f84ee59
msgid ""
"there are many other MAVLink commands that a GCS or other device can send to"
" the autopilot. See the ArduPilot/navlink repository, or the documentation "
"for your GCS."
msgstr "地面站或其他设备可向飞控发送许多其他 MAVLink 指令。请参阅 ArduPilot/navlink 仓库或您的地面站文档。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:13
#: 5f4137a8f2da4290aa1e82f13d3e131f
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:15
#: 77e6cef5d13448c0b728dbb43c179f1e
msgid ""
"The MAVLink protocol defines a large number of `MAV_CMD "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/mavlink/blob/master/message_definitions/v1.0/common.xml#L1008>`__"
" waypoint command types (sent in a ``MAVLink_mission_item_message``). "
"ArduPilot implements handling for the subset of these commands and command "
"parameters that are *most relevant* and meaningful for each of the vehicles."
" Unsupported commands that are sent to a particular autopilot will simply be"
" dropped."
msgstr ""
"MAVLink 协议定义了大量 `MAV_CMD "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/mavlink/blob/master/message_definitions/v1.0/common.xml#L1008>`__"
" 航点指令类型（通过 ``MAVLink_mission_item_message`` 发送）。ArduPilot "
"针对每种飞行器实现了这些指令及指令参数中*最相关、最有意义*的子集。向特定飞控发送不支持的指令将被直接丢弃。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:23
#: be99ff516ecb48b984b42f8e733c2919
msgid ""
"This article lists and describes the commands and command-parameters that "
"are supported on each of the vehicle types. Any parameter that is \"grey\" "
"is not supported by the autopilot and will be ignored. They are still "
"documented to make it clear which properties are supported by the `MAV_CMD "
"protocol "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/mavlink/blob/master/message_definitions/v1.0/common.xml#L1008>`__"
" are not implemented by the vehicle."
msgstr ""
"本文列出并描述了每种飞行器类型支持的指令和指令参数。「灰色」参数表示飞控不支持，将被忽略。这些参数仍被记录在案，以明确说明 `MAV_CMD 协议 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/mavlink/blob/master/message_definitions/v1.0/common.xml#L1008>`__"
" 支持哪些属性但飞行器未实现。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:30
#: 322ce192c73f43009ea4c05d9a6dc0b5
msgid ""
"Some commands and command parameters are not implemented because they are "
"not relevant for particular vehicle types (for example "
"\"MAV_CMD_NAV_TAKEOFF\" command makes sense for Plane and Copter but not "
"Rover and the pitch parameter only makes sense for Plane). There are also "
"some potentially useful command parameters that are not handled because "
"there is a limit to the message size, and a decision has been made to "
"prioritize some parameters over others."
msgstr ""
"部分指令和指令参数未实现，是因为它们与特定飞行器类型不相关（例如 「MAV_CMD_NAV_TAKEOFF」指令对 Plane 和 Copter "
"有意义，但对 Rover 无意义；俯仰参数仅对 Plane 有意义）。另有一些可能有用的指令参数因消息大小限制而未处理，需要在参数之间进行优先级取舍。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:40
#: 79d80ce4dbcd4156bcba49c3f4467aa3
msgid ""
"There is additional information about the supported commands on Copter (from"
" a Mission Planner perspective) in the :ref:`Copter Mission Command List "
"<copter:mission-command-list>`."
msgstr ""
"关于 Copter 支持指令的更多信息（从 Mission Planner 视角），请参阅 :ref:`Copter 任务指令列表 "
"<copter:mission-command-list>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:44
#: 6a84bf8f78ed433a90eeace7b3a6547a
msgid "Types of commands"
msgstr "指令类型"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:46
#: 94f09544d14e4f9eb1a7399060ab7ce6
msgid ""
"There are several different types of commands that can be used within "
"missions:"
msgstr "任务中可使用的指令类型有以下几种："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:49
#: 64bbde176c1846ee89c0db05084d5462
msgid ""
"Navigation commands are used to control the movement of the vehicle, "
"including takeoff, moving to and around waypoints, changing altitude, and "
"landing."
msgstr "导航指令用于控制飞行器的运动，包括起飞、飞往和围绕航点移动、改变高度以及降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:52
#: 3529cde9eaab41e28b8431e1bf3aef3c
msgid ""
"DO commands are for auxiliary functions and do not affect the vehicle’s "
"position (for example, setting the camera trigger distance, or setting a "
"servo value)."
msgstr "DO 指令用于辅助功能，不影响飞行器位置（例如设置相机触发距离或设置舵机值）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:55
#: 687bca5b3e6a40a8824c61d779b71c2f
msgid ""
"Condition commands are used to delay DO commands until some condition is "
"met, for example, the UAV reaches a certain altitude or distance from the "
"waypoint."
msgstr "Condition 指令用于延迟 DO 指令的执行，直到满足某个条件，例如飞行器到达特定高度或距航点的特定距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:59
#: 41b55674c04643fea115c524c6a9f6db
msgid ""
"During a mission at most one “Navigation” command and one “Do” or "
"\"Condition\" command can be running at one time. A typical mission might "
"set a waypoint (NAV command), add a CONDITION command that doesn't complete "
"until a certain distance from the destination "
"(:ref:`MAV_CMD_CONDITION_DISTANCE <mav_cmd_condition_distance>`), and then "
"add a number of DO commands that are executed sequentially (for example "
":ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST <mav_cmd_do_set_cam_trigg_dist>` to take"
" pictures at regular intervals) when the condition completes."
msgstr ""
"在任务执行过程中，同一时刻最多只能运行一个「导航」指令和一个「DO」或「Condition」指令。典型的任务可能包括：设置一个航点（NAV "
"指令），添加一个 CONDITION 指令（在到达目的地一定距离前不完成，参见 :ref:`MAV_CMD_CONDITION_DISTANCE "
"<mav_cmd_condition_distance>`），然后在条件满足后顺序执行一系列 DO 指令（例如使用 "
":ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST <mav_cmd_do_set_cam_trigg_dist>` "
"按固定间隔拍照）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:71
#: c7e5f190a5bc49d7ad8999b4548efa73
msgid ""
"CONDITION and DO commands are associated with the preceding NAV command: if "
"the UAV reaches the next waypoint before these commands are executed, the "
"next NAV command is loaded and they will be skipped."
msgstr ""
"CONDITION 和 DO 指令与前面的 NAV 指令相关联：如果飞行器在这些指令执行完毕前到达下一个航点，则加载下一个 NAV "
"指令，这些指令将被跳过。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:80
#: c15bd8204d564b768e22d330e9e8c3ad
msgid "Frames of reference"
msgstr "参考坐标系"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:82
#: 77cded5c54db4beea5751db8e4135b09
msgid ""
"Many of the commands (in particular the :ref:`NAV\\_ commands <common-"
"mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd_navigation_commands>`) include "
"position/location information. The information is provided relative to a "
"particular \"frame of reference\", which is specified in the message's "
":ref:`common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-"
"mav_cmd_navigation_commands_frames` field. Copter and Rover Mission use "
":ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_SET_HOME <mav_cmd_do_set_home>` command to set the \"home "
"position\" in the global coordinate frame (MAV_FRAME_GLOBAL), `WGS84 "
"coordinate system <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_Geodetic_System>`__, "
"where the altitude is relative to mean sea level. All other commands use the"
" MAV_FRAME_GLOBAL_RELATIVE_ALT frame, which uses the same latitude and "
"longitude, but sets altitude as relative to the *home position* (home "
"altitude = 0)."
msgstr ""
"许多指令（尤其是 :ref:`NAV\\_ 指令 <common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-"
"mav_cmd_navigation_commands>`）包含位置/地点信息。该信息相对于特定的「参考坐标系」提供，在消息的 "
":ref:`common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-"
"mav_cmd_navigation_commands_frames` 字段中指定。Copter 和 Rover 任务使用 "
":ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_SET_HOME <mav_cmd_do_set_home>` "
"指令在全局坐标系（MAV_FRAME_GLOBAL）中设置「Home 位置」，即 `WGS84 坐标系 "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_Geodetic_System>`__ "
"（高度相对于平均海平面）。其他所有指令使用 MAV_FRAME_GLOBAL_RELATIVE_ALT 坐标系，采用相同的纬度和经度，但高度相对于 "
"*Home 位置*（Home 高度 = 0）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:92
#: 444c27385a1c4fe3970961f9de4bd02e
msgid ""
"Plane commands can additionally use MAV_FRAME_GLOBAL_TERRAIN_ALT frame of "
"reference. This again has the same WGS84 frame of reference for "
"latitude/longitude, but specifies altitude relative to ground height (as "
"defined in a terrain database)."
msgstr ""
"Plane 指令还可以使用 MAV_FRAME_GLOBAL_TERRAIN_ALT 参考坐标系。该坐标系采用相同的 WGS84 "
"纬度/经度，但高度相对于地面高度（由地形数据库定义）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:99
#: becbbfb598d645f3ab4e8edbc57cc1fa
msgid ""
"The other frame types are defined in the MAVLink protocol (see `MAV_FRAME "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/mavlink/blob/master/message_definitions/v1.0/common.xml#L795>`__)"
" are not supported for mission commands."
msgstr ""
"MAVLink 协议中定义的其他坐标系类型（参见 `MAV_FRAME "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/mavlink/blob/master/message_definitions/v1.0/common.xml#L795>`__）不支持用于任务指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:104
#: 69d38a4a0a204d80a5540067cc23f18c
msgid "How accurate is the information?"
msgstr "信息的准确性如何？"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:106
#: 1a53ce2ff246499c82c3641f1c8a82f5
msgid ""
"If a command or parameter is marked as supported then it is likely (but not "
"guaranteed) that it will behave as indicated. If a command or parameter is "
"not listed (or marked as not supported) then it is extremely likely that it "
"is not supported on ArduPilot."
msgstr ""
"如果某指令或参数被标记为已支持，则很可能（但不保证）按照说明运行。如果某指令或参数未列出（或标记为不支持），则极大概率在 ArduPilot "
"中不受支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:111
#: 2e77107417f547ce91fcfeceb3e7e576
msgid ""
"The reason for this is that the information was predominantly inferred by "
"inspecting the command handlers for messages:"
msgstr "这是因为相关信息主要是通过检查消息的指令处理程序推断得出的："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:114
#: c76ec48ab12646c4953d70d705f6cd90
msgid ""
"The switch statement in `AP_Mission::mavlink_to_mission_cmd "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Mission/AP_Mission.cpp#L466>`__"
" was inspected to determine which commands are handled by *all* vehicle "
"platforms, and which parameters from the message are stored."
msgstr ""
"通过检查 `AP_Mission::mavlink_to_mission_cmd "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Mission/AP_Mission.cpp#L466>`__"
" 中的 switch 语句，确定*所有*飞行器平台处理的指令以及从消息中存储的参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:117
#: eb8b88105115467bb512f663071dfd67
msgid ""
"The command handler switch for each vehicle type (`Plane "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduPlane/commands_logic.cpp#L33>`__,"
" `Copter "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/commands_logic.cpp#L49>`__,"
" `Rover "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/commands_logic.cpp#L25>`__)"
" tells us which commands are likely to be supported in each vehicle and "
"which parameters are passed to the handler."
msgstr ""
"各飞行器类型的指令处理 switch 语句（`Plane "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduPlane/commands_logic.cpp#L33>`__、`Copter"
" "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/commands_logic.cpp#L49>`__、`Rover"
" "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/commands_logic.cpp#L25>`__）可以告诉我们每种飞行器可能支持哪些指令以及哪些参数传递给处理程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:124
#: 649b3d5bb216407885928f0d9046effd
msgid ""
"The above checks give a very accurate picture of what commands and "
"parameters are not supported. They give a fairly accurate picture of what "
"commands/parameters are *likely to be supported*. However, this indication "
"is not guaranteed to be accurate because a command handler could just throw "
"away all the information (and we have not fully checked all of these)."
msgstr ""
"上述检查能非常准确地反映哪些指令和参数不受支持，也能较为准确地反映哪些指令/参数*可能受支持*。但这并不能保证完全准确，因为指令处理程序可能会丢弃所有信息（我们并未完全检查所有处理程序）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:131
#: 2e5184199bf74e26b56e62ea9eadc679
msgid ""
"In addition to the above checks, we have also merged information from the "
":ref:`Copter Mission Command List <copter:mission-command-list>`."
msgstr ""
"除上述检查外，我们还合并了 :ref:`Copter 任务指令列表 <copter:mission-command-list>` 中的信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:135
#: 89368efcc6ba4d749698633814097183
msgid "How to interpret the command parameters"
msgstr "如何解读指令参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:137
#: 650e8f4a955f4b81bf62d63f9be4f8bc
msgid ""
"The parameters for each command are listed in a table. The parameters that "
"are \"greyed out\" are not supported. The command field column (param name) "
"uses \"bold\" text to indicate those parameters that are defined in the "
"protocol (normal text is used for \"empty\" parameters)."
msgstr ""
"每个指令的参数均以表格形式列出。「灰色」参数表示不支持。指令字段列（参数名）使用「粗体」文本标识协议中定义的参数（普通文本用于「空」参数）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:142
#: 0ce25a87046e4974892b8d50747eaf25
msgid ""
"This allows users/developers to see both what is supported, and what "
"protocol fields are not supported in ArduPilot."
msgstr "这使用户/开发者能够同时了解 ArduPilot 支持和不支持的内容。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:146
#: 5698671139e84e94bb75b1460b7b9318
msgid "Using this information with a GCS"
msgstr "在地面站中使用这些信息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:148
#: cb29f25718024488966aaf38300c43b4
msgid ""
"*Mission Planner* (MP) exposes the full subset of commands and parameters "
"supported by ArduPilot, filtered to display just those relevant to the "
"currently connected vehicle. Mapping the MP commands to this documentation "
"is easy, because it simply names commands using a cut-down version of the "
"full command name (e.g. ``DO_SET_SERVO`` rather than the full command name: "
"``MAV_CMD_DO_SET_SERVO``). In addition, this document conveniently lists the"
" column label used by Mission Planner alongside each of the parameters."
msgstr ""
"*Mission Planner*（MP）公开了 ArduPilot 支持的完整指令和参数子集，并过滤为仅显示与当前连接飞行器相关的内容。将 MP "
"指令映射到本文档很简单，因为它使用完整指令名的简化版本来命名指令（例如 ``DO_SET_SERVO`` 而非完整指令名 "
"``MAV_CMD_DO_SET_SERVO``）。此外，本文档方便地在每个参数旁边列出了 Mission Planner 使用的列标签。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:157
#: cf11926d4fdc4dc2848e8ec5ed6029d0
msgid ""
"Other GCSs (APM Planner 2, Tower etc.) may support some other subset of "
"commands/parameters and use alternative names/labels for them. In most "
"cases, the mapping should be obvious."
msgstr ""
"其他地面站（APM Planner 2、Tower 等）可能支持某些其他指令/参数子集，并使用不同的名称/标签。大多数情况下，映射关系应该很明显。"

