msgid "Mission Planner Settings for DO_JUMP command"
msgstr "DO_JUMP 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:475
#: 46746653236a4cd3856ae44a33b6512b
msgid ""
"In the example above the vehicle would fly back-and-forth between waypoints "
"#1 and #2 a total of 3 times before flying on to waypoint #4."
msgstr "在上述示例中，飞行器将在航点 #1 和 #2 之间来回飞行共 3 次，然后继续飞往航点 #4。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:481
#: 5d2c806ff4db4d45932f931a87d9670f
msgid "MAV_CMD_JUMP_TAG"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_JUMP_TAG"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:485
#: 21d4c25abd394f13bd5c1434efb7ba61
msgid ""
"This is a location marker in the mission command sequence that can be used "
"as a \"jump to\" location for the "
":ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP_TAG<MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP_TAG>` command. The tag id in its "
"parameter field can be any arbitrary number between 1 and 65535."
msgstr ""
"这是任务指令序列中的位置标记，可作为 :ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP_TAG<MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP_TAG>` "
"指令的「跳转目标」位置。参数字段中的标签 ID 可以是 1 到 65535 之间的任意数字。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:541
#: 744631f3dac44692a9eed6b8d80d34ab
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP_TAG"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP_TAG"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:545
#: 4841b2a0db0b457f8ea16b6e10946aa2
msgid ""
"Jump to the specified :ref:`MAV_CMD_JUMP_TAG<MAV_CMD_JUMP_TAG>` item in the "
"mission list. The jump tag command can be repeated, either a specified "
"number of times before continuing the mission, or it can be repeated "
"indefinitely."
msgstr ""
"跳转到任务列表中指定的 :ref:`MAV_CMD_JUMP_TAG<MAV_CMD_JUMP_TAG>` "
"项。跳转标签指令可以重复，在继续任务前重复指定次数，也可以无限期重复。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:558
#: f1d534ea2f15445b969b0689ca5fec17
msgid ""
"There can be a maximum of 15 jump_tag commands in a mission after which new "
"DO_JUMP_TAG commands are ignored."
msgstr "一次任务中最多可有 15 条 jump_tag 指令，超出后新的 DO_JUMP_TAG 指令将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:620
#: ccf39d6778714ef4ae57e1ac35a9ba6e
msgid "Mission Planner Settings for DO_JUMP_TAG command"
msgstr "DO_JUMP_TAG 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:622
#: 53a6f5edbfef4ceea820300836bf0128
msgid ""
"In the example above, the vehicle would fly back-and-forth between waypoints"
" #3 and #4 a total of 3 times before completing the mission. This is because"
" the DO_JUMP_TAG redirects the vehicle to JUMP_TAG #565 twice."
msgstr ""
"在上述示例中，飞行器将在航点 #3 和 #4 之间来回飞行共 3 次后完成任务。这是因为 DO_JUMP_TAG 将飞行器重定向到 JUMP_TAG "
"#565 两次。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:625
#: 4f88ad2cfb634a578918bdc3aa3039e0
msgid "Conditional commands"
msgstr "条件指令"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:627
#: e93dd9c80c0f43918091f9ab619117dc
msgid ""
"Conditional commands control the execution of \\_DO\\_ commands. For "
"example, a conditional command can prevent DO commands from executing based "
"on a time delay, until the vehicle is at a certain altitude, or at a "
"specified distance from the next target position."
msgstr "条件指令控制 \\_DO\\_ 指令的执行。例如，条件指令可以根据时间延迟、直到飞行器到达特定高度或距下一目标位置特定距离来阻止 DO 指令执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:632
#: 2a823c6178ba49a991a5d93fc41c96a5
msgid ""
"A conditional command may not be complete before reaching the next waypoint."
" In this case, any unexecuted \\_DO\\_ commands associated with the last "
"waypoint will be skipped."
msgstr "条件指令可能在到达下一个航点前尚未完成。在这种情况下，与上一个航点相关联的任何未执行的 \\_DO\\_ 指令将被跳过。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:639
#: 5228457d5bad4bedb9db7a92e3c60539
msgid "MAV_CMD_CONDITION_DELAY"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_CONDITION_DELAY"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:643
#: 2bf872c5283849e0bf78b4d4736b363a
msgid ""
"After reaching a waypoint, delay the execution of the next conditional "
"\"_DO_\" command for the specified number of seconds (e.g. "
":ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI <mav_cmd_do_set_roi>`)."
msgstr ""
"到达航点后，将下一条条件「_DO_」指令（例如 :ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI "
"<mav_cmd_do_set_roi>`）的执行延迟指定秒数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:649
#: a19690ca11014965be5553219e079e3a
msgid ""
"This command does not stop the vehicle. If the vehicle reaches the next "
"waypoint before the delay timer completes, the delayed \"_DO_\" commands "
"will never trigger."
msgstr "此指令不会停止飞行器。如果飞行器在延迟计时器完成前到达下一个航点，延迟的「_DO_」指令将永远不会触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:708
#: 5df497d2963b49919754d04dcfa5a223
msgid "Mission Planner Settings for CONDITION_DELAY command"
msgstr "CONDITION_DELAY 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:710
#: 2d77349c186848d09f68adb58b0eb339
msgid ""
"In the example above, Command #4 (``DO_SET_ROI``) is delayed so that it "
"starts 5 seconds after the vehicle has passed Waypoint #2."
msgstr "在上述示例中，指令 #4（``DO_SET_ROI``）被延迟，使其在飞行器经过航点 #2 后 5 秒才开始执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:717
#: a2adf627cc5d4fd9b197363047b5af35
msgid "MAV_CMD_CONDITION_DISTANCE"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_CONDITION_DISTANCE"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:721
#: 80b1ff7b05434fb1a19477d87e49d737
msgid ""
"Delays the start of the next \"``_DO_``\\ \" command until the vehicle is "
"within the specified number of meters of the next waypoint."
msgstr "延迟下一条「``_DO_``\\ 」指令的执行，直到飞行器距下一个航点在指定米数范围内。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:726
#: d27730ccd0504d1c80b370d969d67494
msgid "This command does not stop the vehicle: it only affects DO commands."
msgstr "此指令不会停止飞行器：它只影响 DO 指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:783
#: 16fc830daf114ee8944845ed5d0ec30c
msgid "Mission PlannerSettings for CONDITION_DISTANCE command"
msgstr "CONDITION_DISTANCE 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:785
#: fba54197a1814bfd91c371b560ea228c
msgid ""
"In the example above, Command #4 (``DO_SET_ROI``) is delayed so that it only"
" starts once the vehicle is within 50m of waypoint #5."
msgstr "在上述示例中，指令 #4（``DO_SET_ROI``）被延迟，使其仅在飞行器距航点 #5 50m 范围内时才开始执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:795
#: 8833716307f14235b35ee8c191a71d93
msgid "DO commands"
msgstr "DO 指令"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:797
#: 70b8f84d54b44aa7889d1474faa1c5c4
msgid ""
"The \"DO\" or \"Now\" commands are executed once to perform some action. All"
" the DO commands associated with a waypoint are executed immediately."
msgstr "「DO」或「立即」指令被执行一次以执行某个动作。与航点相关的所有 DO 指令立即执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:805
#: 8fc63048cbca446e9b9168491718bd2c
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_CHANGE_SPEED"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_CHANGE_SPEED"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:818
#: 3678244a3a634d40aaec656b394f90e1
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_HOME"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_HOME"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:822
#: cf2ca21310644f2790c58d305d1d741b
msgid ""
"Sets the home location either as the current location or at the location "
"specified in the command. For SITL work, altitude input here needs to be "
"with reference to absolute altitude, taking into account SRTM elevation."
msgstr "将 Home 位置设置为当前位置或指令中指定的位置。对于 SITL 工作，此处输入的高度需参考绝对高度，并考虑 SRTM 高程数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:827
#: 645aafb725c64378b78418f25d5d2b75
msgid ""
"For Plane and Rover, if a good GPS fix cannot be obtained the location "
"specified in the command is used."
msgstr "对于 Plane 和 Rover，如果无法获取良好的 GPS 定位，则使用指令中指定的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:829
#: fdd1b89931e649aa860c137a47cd322f
msgid ""
"For Copter, the command will also try to use the current position if all the"
" location parameters are set to 0. The location information in the command "
"is only used if it is close to the EKF origin."
msgstr "对于 Copter，如果所有位置参数均设置为 0，该指令也会尝试使用当前位置。指令中的位置信息仅在其接近 EKF 原点时使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:894
#: bce7cce5bc624adcbe8c8b2a51496e95
msgid "Mission Planner Settings for DO_SET_HOME command"
msgstr "DO_SET_HOME 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:899
#: 85b0356495f54db1a7135c5cb971da88
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_RELAY"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_RELAY"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:903
#: 13245fe6b0064caaad7852ba1e0e08ba
msgid "Set a `Relay <common-relay>`__ pin's voltage high (on) or low (off)."
msgstr "将 `继电器 <common-relay>`__ 引脚电压设为高电平（开）或低电平（关）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:966
#: c5434d70818d49998a22c3ea3c80babb
msgid "MissionPlanner Settings for DO_SET_RELAY command"
msgstr "DO_SET_RELAY 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:971
#: e1268bf9dd0e4a52ae5d16b82523c1d3
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_REPEAT_RELAY"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_REPEAT_RELAY"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:975
#: d26c6caf82ac450ba274238d7b78059b
msgid ""
"Toggle the :ref:`Relay <common-relay>` pin's voltage/state a specified "
"number of times with a given period. Toggling the Relay will turn an off "
"relay on and vice versa"
msgstr "以给定周期将 :ref:`继电器 <common-relay>` 引脚电压/状态切换指定次数。切换继电器将使关闭的继电器打开，反之亦然"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1033
#: 077011d733a248359393f9984978fec8
msgid "Mission Planner Settings for DO_RELAY_REPEAT command"
msgstr "DO_RELAY_REPEAT 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1035
#: 303ed4599f464d1cb38616b78a66e5b8
msgid ""
"In the example above, assuming the relay was off to begin with, it would be "
"set high and then after 3 seconds, it would be toggled low again."
msgstr "在上述示例中，假设继电器初始状态为关，它将被设为高电平，然后 3 秒后再次切换为低电平。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1041
#: e69c8f8dfb4d426c96dc00cbf4531987
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_SERVO"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_SERVO"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1045
#: 25a0a3736c6a4a618943b5b5ffdf4806
msgid ""
"Set a given :ref:`servo pin <common-servo>` output to a specific PWM value."
msgstr "将指定的 :ref:`舵机引脚 <common-servo>` 输出设置为特定 PWM 值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1101
#: 4ae6aa322d214584be02588d5fd903f1
msgid "Mission Planner Settingsfor DO_SET_SERVO command"
msgstr "DO_SET_SERVO 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1103
#: 927c53e75ab84c6b92e512878d819b8e
msgid ""
"In the example above, the servo attached to output channel 8 would be moved "
"to PWM 1700 (servos generally accept PWM values between 1000 and 2000)."
msgstr "在上述示例中，连接到输出通道 8 的舵机将移动到 PWM 1700（舵机通常接受 1000 到 2000 之间的 PWM 值）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1107
#: 56b0e82d148544f7932e7b8686ad0014
msgid ""
"as of firmware versions 4.0 and later, this command can be used on any "
"output configured by its ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` command as 0,1, or 51-66  "
"(disabled or RC pass-throughs)"
msgstr ""
"从固件 4.0 版本起，此指令可用于任何通过 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 命令配置为 0、1 或 51-66（禁用或 RC 直通）的输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1112
#: 959d3625cbf34c0d8193b4ab474df081
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_REPEAT_SERVO"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_REPEAT_SERVO"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1116
#: 1e48f39dfe2c42d5b235d6a0ce930652
msgid ""
"Cycle a :ref:`servo <common-servo>` PWM output pin between its mid-position "
"value and a specified PWM value, for a given number of cycles and with a set"
" period."
msgstr ""
"在给定周期和设定次数内，将 :ref:`舵机 <common-servo>` PWM 输出引脚在其中间位置值和指定 PWM 值之间循环切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1120
#: 543e7e7a30d840d1bc91d8ba05ab5624
msgid ""
"The mid-position value is specified in the ``RCn_TRIM`` parameter for the "
"channel (``RC8_TRIM`` in the screenshot below). The default value is 1500.."
msgstr "中间位置值在该通道的 ``RCn_TRIM`` 参数中指定（下方截图中为 ``RC8_TRIM``）。默认值为 1500。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1178
#: 082d4689573d46cdbf419174879c3d38
msgid "Mission Planner Settingsfor DO_REPEAT_SERVO command"
msgstr "DO_REPEAT_SERVO 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1180
#: 8a0c2d68b806446b948eeaeaf4faf17b
msgid ""
"In the example above, the servo attached to output channel 8 would be moved "
"to PWM 1700, then after 4 second, back to mid, after another 4 seconds it "
"would be moved to 1700 again, then finally after 4 more seconds it would be "
"moved back to mid."
msgstr ""
"在上述示例中，连接到输出通道 8 的舵机将移动到 PWM 1700，4 秒后返回中间位置，再过 4 秒后再次移动到 1700，最后再过 4 "
"秒后返回中间位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1192
#: 46017286d3634802b1411674b14d7543
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1204
#: d5bee59ad1ec44e8ab540161d75de3ee
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_DIGICAM_CONFIGURE"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_DIGICAM_CONFIGURE"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1208
#: 7f5016ea7a9549a3b6a45c9ada7b4720
msgid "Configure an on-board camera controller system."
msgstr "配置机载相机控制器系统。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1210
#: abfc417c496846ff825b43cf801d3b38
msgid ""
"The parameters are forwarded to an on-board camera controller system (like "
"the `3DR Camera Control Board <common-camera-control-board>`__), if one is "
"present."
msgstr ""
"参数将被转发到机载相机控制器系统（如 `3DR Camera Control Board <common-camera-control-"
"board>`__）（如果存在）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1280
#: 7b3f1adc3f3647f4b860e477e9370b7e
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1284
#: d810b456b65a4ebf96fe33e0ae5d6643
msgid ""
"Trigger the :ref:`camera shutter <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>` once. "
"This command takes no additional arguments."
msgstr "触发 :ref:`相机快门 <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>` 一次。此指令不需要额外参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1288
#: 8064b08fff164702af788de439470d45
msgid "In general, if a command field is set to 0 it is ignored."
msgstr "通常，如果指令字段设置为 0，则被忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1353
#: 78607482108d4e169404b3bc6fda889f
msgid "Mission PlannerSettings for DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL command."
msgstr "DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL 指令的 Mission Planner 设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1358
#: ed27da078e444c6eb57c5b972aefe054
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_MOUNT_CONTROL"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_MOUNT_CONTROL"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1362
#: d71d4d073da7429d84a7c65b4b08e1df
msgid "Mission command to control a camera or antenna mount."
msgstr "用于控制相机或天线挂载的任务指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1364
#: d37c01fb2a2e4a108a55360b0edc3bba
msgid ""
"This command allows you to specify a roll, pitch and yaw angle which will be"
" sent to the :ref:`camera gimbal <common-cameras-and-gimbals>`. This can be "
"used to point the camera in specific directions at various times in the "
"mission."
msgstr ""
"此指令允许您指定横滚、俯仰和偏航角度，并将其发送至 :ref:`相机云台 <common-cameras-and-"
"gimbals>`。可用于在任务的不同时刻将相机指向特定方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1423
#: 919fa776d84447b8ae84c54b42f32e6d
msgid "Mission Planner Settings for DO_MOUNT_CONTROL command"
msgstr "DO_MOUNT_CONTROL 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

