msgid ""
"Mission command to move the gimbal to the desired pitch and yaw angles (in "
"degrees)."
msgstr "将云台移动到期望俯仰和偏航角度（度）的任务指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1434
#: a7ee222eb99446c7a2ac21dcd364c9d1
msgid ""
"This command allows you to specify a pitch and yaw angle which will be sent "
"to the :ref:`camera gimbal <common-cameras-and-gimbals>`. This can be used "
"to point the camera in specific directions at various times in the mission. "
"Positive pitch angles are up, Negative are down.  Positive yaw angles are "
"clockwise, negative are counter clockwise."
msgstr ""
"此指令允许您指定俯仰和偏航角度，并将其发送至 :ref:`相机云台 <common-cameras-and-"
"gimbals>`。可用于在任务的不同时刻将相机指向特定方向。俯仰角正值表示向上，负值表示向下。偏航角正值为顺时针，负值为逆时针。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1493
#: a87ed8f9e9aa4ca493d20736d869b74d
msgid "Mission PlannerSettings for DO_GIMBAL_MANAGE_PITCHYAW command"
msgstr "DO_GIMBAL_MANAGE_PITCHYAW 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

