#~ msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_TAKEOFF"
#~ msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_TAKEOFF"

#~ msgid "Supported by: Copter, Plane (not Rover)."
#~ msgstr "支持的飞行器：Copter、Plane（不含 Rover）。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Takeoff (either from the ground or by hand-launch). It should be the first "
#~ "command of nearly all Plane and Copter missions."
#~ msgstr "起飞（从地面或手抛起飞）。该指令应作为几乎所有 Plane 和 Copter 任务的第一条指令。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The vehicle will climb straight up from its current location to the "
#~ "specified altitude. If the mission is begun while the copter is already "
#~ "flying, the vehicle will climb straight up to the specified altitude, if the"
#~ " vehicle is already above the altitude the command will be ignored and the "
#~ "mission will move on to the next command immediately."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "飞行器将从当前位置垂直爬升至指定高度。如果任务开始时飞行器已在飞行中，则垂直爬升至指定高度；如果飞行器已高于该高度，则忽略该指令并立即执行下一条指令。"

#~ msgid "Copter: Mission Planner Settings for TAKEOFF command"
#~ msgstr "Copter：TAKEOFF 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Fly to the specified location and then loiter there indefinitely — where "
#~ "loiter means \"wait in place\" (rather than \"circle\"). If zero is "
#~ "specified for a latitude/longitude/altitude parameter then the current "
#~ "location value for the parameter will be used."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "飞往指定位置并在该处无限期悬停——此处悬停指「在原地等待」（而非「绕圈飞行」）。如果纬度/经度/高度参数中任一指定为零，则使用该参数的当前位置值。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The mission will not proceed past this command while in AUTO mode. In order "
#~ "to break out of this command you need to change the mode (i.e. to MANUAL). "
#~ "If there are subsequent commands then you can continue the mission at the "
#~ "next command, if the Copter ``MIS_RESTART`` parameter is set to resume, by "
#~ "switching back to AUTO mode (otherwise the mission will restart)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "在 AUTO 模式下，任务不会跳过此指令继续执行。要退出此指令，需要切换飞行模式（例如切换到 MANUAL 模式）。如果后续还有其他指令，可将飞行器的 "
#~ "``MIS_RESTART`` 参数设置为恢复模式，然后切换回 AUTO 模式以从下一条指令继续任务（否则任务将从头开始）。"

#~ msgid "Copter: Mission Planner Settings for LOITER_UNLIM command"
#~ msgstr "Copter：LOITER_UNLIM 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#~ msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_LOITER_TURNS"
#~ msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_LOITER_TURNS"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Loiter (circle) the specified location for at least the specified number of "
#~ "complete turns, and then proceed to the next command upon intersection of "
#~ "the course to it with the circle's perimeter. If zero is specified for a "
#~ "latitude/longitude/altitude parameter then the current location value for "
#~ "the parameter will be used. Fractional turns between 0 and 1 are supported, "
#~ "while turns greater than 1 must be integers."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "在指定位置盘旋（绕圈）至少指定的完整圈数，然后在飞行路线与圆弧相交时继续执行下一条指令。如果纬度/经度/高度参数中任一指定为零，则使用该参数的当前位置值。支持"
#~ " 0 到 1 之间的小数圈数，大于 1 的圈数必须为整数。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The radius of the circle is controlled by the command parameter. A radius of"
#~ " 0 will result in the copter loitering at the location and pirouetting the "
#~ "specified number of turns. Negative radius values result in counter-"
#~ "clockwise turns instead of clockwise turns. Radius values over 255 meters "
#~ "will be rounded down to the nearest 10 meter mark."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "圆圈半径由指令参数控制。半径为 0 时，飞行器将在原地悬停并原地旋转指定圈数。负半径值将使飞行器逆时针转圈而非顺时针。超过 255 "
#~ "米的半径值将向下取整到最近的 10 米整数。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "This is the command equivalent of the :ref:`Circle flight mode "
#~ "<copter:circle-mode>`."
#~ msgstr "此指令等同于 :ref:`Circle 飞行模式 <copter:circle-mode>`。"

#~ msgid "Copter: Mission Planner Settings for LOITER_TURNS command"
#~ msgstr "Copter：LOITER_TURNS 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Fly/Drive to the specified location and then loiter there for the specified "
#~ "number of seconds — where loiter means \"wait in place\" (rather than "
#~ "\"circle\"). The timer starts when the waypoint is reached; when it expires "
#~ "the waypoint is complete. If zero is specified for a "
#~ "latitude/longitude/altitude parameter then the current location value for "
#~ "the parameter will be used."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "飞往/驶往指定位置，然后在该处悬停指定秒数——此处悬停指「在原地等待」（而非「绕圈飞行」）。计时器在到达航点时开始；到期后航点完成。如果纬度/经度/高度参数中任一指定为零，则使用该参数的当前位置值。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "This is the mission equivalent of the :ref:`Loiter flight mode "
#~ "<copter:loiter-mode>` or :ref:`Hold mode <rover:hold-mode>`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "此指令等同于任务中的 :ref:`Loiter 飞行模式 <copter:loiter-mode>` 或 :ref:`Hold 模式 "
#~ "<rover:hold-mode>`。"

#~ msgid "Copter: Mission Planner Settings for LOITER_TIME command"
#~ msgstr "Copter：LOITER_TIME 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#~ msgid "Copter"
#~ msgstr "Copter"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Return to the *home location* (or the nearest :ref:`Rally Point <common-"
#~ "rally-points>` if closer) and then land. The home location is where the "
#~ "vehicle was last armed (or when it first gets GPS lock after arming if the "
