#~ "使用 `样条曲线路径 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spline_%28mathematics%29>`__ "
#~ "飞往目标位置，然后等待（悬停）指定时间后继续执行下一条指令。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The Spline commands take all the same arguments are regular waypoints (lat, "
#~ "lon, alt, delay) but when executed the vehicle will fly smooth paths (both "
#~ "vertically and horizontally) instead of straight lines. Spline waypoints can"
