#~ msgstr "这不是「任务指令」（不能作为任务航点类型使用）。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Sets the desired maximum speed in meters/second (only). Both the speed-type "
#~ "and throttle settings are ignored."
#~ msgstr "仅设置期望最大速度（米/秒）。速度类型和油门设置均被忽略。"

#~ msgid "Copter: Mission Planner Settings for DO_CHANGE_SPEED command"
#~ msgstr "Copter：DO_CHANGE_SPEED 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Points the :ref:`camera gimbal <common-cameras-and-gimbals>` at the \"region"
#~ " of interest\", and also rotates the nose of the vehicle if the mount type "
#~ "does not support a yaw feature."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "将 :ref:`相机云台 <common-cameras-and-gimbals>` "
#~ "指向「感兴趣区域」，如果挂载类型不支持偏航功能，还会旋转飞行器机头。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "After setting the ROI, the camera/vehicle will continue to follow it until "
#~ "the end of the mission, unless it is changed or cleared by setting another "
#~ "ROI. Clearing the ROI is achieved by setting a later DO_SET_ROI command with"
#~ " all zero for ``param5``-``param7`` (Lat, Lon and Alt)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "设置 ROI 后，相机/飞行器将持续跟踪该区域，直到任务结束，除非通过设置另一个 ROI 来更改或清除。清除 ROI 的方法是在后续设置一条 "
#~ "DO_SET_ROI 指令，将 ``param5``-``param7``（纬度、经度和高度）全部设为零。"

