#~ msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_GUIDED_LIMITS"
#~ msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_GUIDED_LIMITS"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "This command sets the time, altitude, and distance limits for external "
#~ "control (GUIDED mode). When these limits are exceeded, control will return "
#~ "from GUIDED mode to the mission. Setting any of these parameters to zero "
#~ "will remove the associated limit."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "此指令设置外部控制（GUIDED 模式）的时间、高度和距离限制。超出这些限制后，控制权将从 GUIDED "
#~ "模式返回到任务。将任何参数设置为零将取消相应限制。"

